{"product_id":"memomind-one-standard","title":"MemoMind One - Standard","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cmeta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text\/html; charset=utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003eFully Customizable AI Glasses: \u003c\/b\u003eAI glasses without a camera. Prescription-ready. Built for all-day wear.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003eUltra-Light Comfort Fit: \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eDesigned to feel like regular glasses — light, natural, and wearable all day.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003eDual-Eye Display: \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eImmersive yet subtle AR experience that keeps information right in your view.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003eHarman AudioEFX Stereo Sound: \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003ePrecision-tuned audio for calls, AI interaction, and everyday listening\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003eCamera-Free Privacy Design: \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eNo camera. No recording. Built for privacy-first, everyday use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"MemoMind","offers":[{"title":"Nomad \/ Non-Prescription Lenses","offer_id":43269620105329,"sku":"GMN_1000","price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Nomad \/ Prescription Lenses","offer_id":43269621907569,"sku":"GMN_Z_1000","price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gotham \/ Non-Prescription L